  "body_html": "<h1>welfareMaximizer_ge</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma welfareMaximizer_ge (A : KnapsackAuction I U) (b : I → U) (hW : 0 ≤ A.totalCapacity) {x : BinaryAllocation I} (hx : x ∈ A.feasibleBinaryAllocations) : binarySocialWelfare b x ≤ binarySocialWelfare b (A.welfareMaximizer b hW)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BinaryAllocation</li>\n<li>binarySocialWelfare</li>\n<li>exists_welfareMaximizer</li>\n</ul>",
